      "alt": "Rey:\n\nGetting demolished on Tuesday — including watching Latino turnout flip against them after a year of his deportation raids — and deciding on Friday afternoon that the fix is putting Stephen Miller in charge of the entire West Wing is pure bunker brain.\nThree weeks ago Trump was insisting there was \"zero chance\" Wiles was leaving, and now the last semi-normal campaign operator in the building gets parked at \"the Trump Political Operation\" so Nosferatu can run the Chief of Staff desk starting Monday. With Congress flipping and legislation dead on arrival in January, handing the keys to the one guy whose entire theory of government is unilateral executive cruelty and DHS stunts tells you exactingly what the next two years are going to be — ugly for places like Minneapolis where ICE is already digging in, and catastrophic for whatever's left of their coalition.\n(Also that third reply under Sahil's post — \"They have to move Millers casket into the ballroom before sealing the foundation\" — got me 💀)",
